WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:03.580
After the surgery site has healed,

2
00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:05.820
you return for your first programming visit.

3
00:00:06.420 --> 00:00:08.740
At the visit, a hearing specialist called

4
00:00:08.767 --> 00:00:11.780
an audiologist programs the speech processor you

5
00:00:11.844 --> 00:00:13.220
wear outside your ear.

6
00:00:13.460 --> 00:00:16.020
The program is made for your needs.

7
00:00:16.620 --> 00:00:19.100
At later visits, the team checks the implant

8
00:00:19.120 --> 00:00:21.580
and equipment and measures how they are working.

9
00:00:21.840 --> 00:00:25.260
You will keep returning for checks and fine-tuning.
